ailable, proceed to the final step of updating DNS records.</li></ol><h2 data-identifyelement=\"304\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"305\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"306\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 16px;\">Step 2: Update CNAME and A record with your DNS provider</span></strong></h2><ol data-identifyelement=\"307\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><li data-identifyelement=\"308\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Add the provided CNAME and A records to your DNS provider.</li><li data-identifyelement=\"309\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"310\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">Once the records are successfully added click on 'Verify DNS Records' button.&nbsp;</span></li></ol><p data-identifyelement=\"311\" style=\"box-sizing: