 further assistance or if you have any questions, please contact our support team. Enjoy the new domain management experience!</p>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006535-whatsapp-onboarding-failure-please-create-a-new-whatsapp-business-account-since-a-payment-method-al", "title": "WhatsApp Onboarding Failure: \u201cPlease create a new WhatsApp Business Account since a payment method already exists for the current WhatsApp Business Account\u201d", "folder": "Setup", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055281127/original/-yXYL6tLjCASLWs0zwCdU5a3dEBThzrdZA2df8.png?1759733685"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">If you encounter the error message:</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\"><em style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\u201cPlease create a new WhatsApp Business Account since a payment method already exists for the current WhatsApp Business Account.\u201d</em></strong></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">This means that your existing WhatsApp Business Account (WABA) already has an active payment method associated with it.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\">Meta does not allow a WABA with an existing payment method to be connected again through another platform. Therefore, the onboarding process will fail if you try to reuse that WABA.<br><br><img src=\"../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155055281127/original/-yXYL6tLjCASLWs0zwCdU5a3dEBThzrdZA2df8.png?1759733685\" style=\"width: auto; max-width: 100%;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"155055281127\"><br></p><p><span class=\"fr-view collab-annotatable\" data-test-id=\"article-description\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; cursor: auto; display: block;\"></span></p><h3 data-end=\"830\" data-start=\"806\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Why This Happens</strong></h3><p data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"832\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">This error occurs because:</p><ul data-end=\"1164\" data-start=\"861\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"1005\" data-start=\"861\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1005\" data-start=\"863\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">The WABA you are trying to connect has already been used previously (either directly in Meta or through another Business Solution Provider).</p></li><li data-end=\"1164\" data-start=\"1006\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1164\" data-start=\"1008\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Meta prevents connecting a WABA that already has a billing setup or payment method to another BSP (Business Solution Provider) to avoid duplicate billing.</p></li></ul><h3 data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1171\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-end=\"1199\" data-start=\"1175\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">How to Fix the Issue</strong></h3><p data-end=\"1342\" data-start=\"1201\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">To successfully complete onboarding, you need to <strong data-end=\"1299\" data-start=\"1250\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">create a new WhatsApp Business Account (WABA)</strong> under your existing Meta Business Manager.</p><p data-end=\"1367\" data-start=\"1344\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Follow the steps below:</p><h4 data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1369\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1em;\"><strong data-end=\"1419\" data-start=\"1374\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 1: Go to Your Meta Business Settings</strong></h4><ol data-end=\"1570\" data-start=\"1420\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li data-end=\"1496\" data-start=\"1420\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1496\" data-start=\"1423\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Visit <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" data-end=\"1493\" data-start=\"1429\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_new\">Meta Business Settings</a>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1570\" data-start=\"1497\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1570\" data-start=\"1500\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Log in using the Facebook account that manages your business assets.</p></li></ol><h4 data-end=\"1627\" data-start=\"1572\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1em;\"><strong data-end=\"1627\" data-start=\"1577\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 2: Create a New WhatsApp Business Account</strong></h4><ol data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1628\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1699\" data-start=\"1631\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">In the <strong data-end=\"1656\" data-start=\"1638\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">left-hand menu</strong>, go to <strong data-end=\"1696\" data-start=\"1664\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Accounts \u2192 WhatsApp Accounts</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1724\" data-start=\"1700\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1724\" data-start=\"1703\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Click on <strong data-end=\"1721\" data-start=\"1712\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">+ Add</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1780\" data-start=\"1725\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1780\" data-start=\"1728\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Select <strong data-end=\"1777\" data-start=\"1735\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Create a New WhatsApp Business Account</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"1860\" data-start=\"1781\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1860\" data-start=\"1784\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Enter a unique name for the new account (example: <em data-end=\"1856\" data-start=\"1834\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">YourBusinessName-New</em>).</p></li><li data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1861\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1893\" data-start=\"1864\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Complete the setup prompts.</p></li></ol><h4 data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1895\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 21.88px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1em;\"><strong data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1900\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Step 3: Return to Whatsapp Onboarding Flow</strong></h4><ol data-end=\"2128\" data-start=\"1932\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px;\"><li data-end=\"1988\" data-start=\"1932\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"1988\" data-start=\"1935\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Go back to your WhatsApp onboarding flow.</p></li><li data-end=\"2081\" data-start=\"1989\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2081\" data-start=\"1992\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">When prompted to select a WhatsApp Business Account, choose the <strong data-end=\"2078\" data-start=\"2056\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">newly created WABA</strong>.</p></li><li data-end=\"2128\" data-start=\"2082\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2128\" data-start=\"2085\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Continue the onboarding process normally.</p></li></ol><h3 data-end=\"2158\" data-start=\"2135\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: inherit; font-weight: 400; line-height: 30.63px; color: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 1.17em;\"><strong data-end=\"2158\" data-start=\"2139\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Additional Tips</strong></h3><ul data-end=\"2525\" data-start=\"2159\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 4px; margin-left: 0px; padding: 0px 0px 0px 40px; line-height: 17px; list-style: disc;\"><li data-end=\"2241\" data-start=\"2159\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2241\" data-start=\"2161\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Do <strong data-end=\"2171\" data-start=\"2164\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">not</strong> delete your old WABA if it\u2019s linked to other services or campaigns.</p></li><li data-end=\"2410\" data-start=\"2242\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2410\" data-start=\"2244\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">If you are unsure which payment method is attached, visit <a class=\"decorated-link cursor-pointer\" data-end=\"2381\" data-start=\"2302\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197); cursor: pointer;\" target=\"_new\">Meta Payment Settings</a> to review existing setups.</p></li><li data-end=\"2525\" data-start=\"2411\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><p data-end=\"2525\" data-start=\"2413\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">Always use a <strong data-end=\"2438\" data-start=\"2426\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">new WABA</strong> for onboarding if you\u2019ve previously connected the same number with another provider.</p></li></ul><p></p><div class=\"attachment-thumb ember-view\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><br class=\"Apple-interchange-newline\"></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "155000006998-printify-integration-for-ecommerce-stores", "title": "Printify Integration for Ecommerce Stores", "folder": "Ecommerce", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027390/original/UWd5hCk_GD7sAwVu7WCxdZ993yZTuMtJ5w2dfc.jpg?1763921167", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027515/original/x03nG1GzaXe7LkyNMbMj8RUpVqvy6xrbcQ4cc6.jpg?1763921646", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027514/original/kjA9vEcE9FODeeq1Ea0_J2hu7W7Ns2cDZAa0bf.jpg?1763921645", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027486/original/u46UPprExz7KwP9vSmyV0i_uEsOCGdInLA021b.png?1763921497", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027516/original/vwo0MAtYs3zho_Ua3ROXNt1iLQbygXDo4g4cc6.jpg?1763921646", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027501/original/TxNV95k0Ugtxw1K-3Pnl8PUNNNIq-ocQZA6092.png?1763921561", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/155059027531/original/jlmq9aZn1bjPiE3xDRTbf4A_EhffHHq7Dw641d.png?1763921718"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-4c86c81a-34c9-4fe1-b596-7c390ff59a1d\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: &quot;Source Sans Pro&quot;; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Skip the inventory hassle and still sell branded merch. Connect your CRM store to Printify\u2019s catalog of 1,000+ products and 85+ global print providers, and every order is made on demand\u2014no boxes, no bulk buys.&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"fd-toc\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p class=\"fd-toc\"><strong>TABLE OF CONTENTS</strong></p><ul><li><a href=\"#What-is-Printify-Integration?\">What is Printify Integration?</a></li><li><a href=\"#Key-Benefits-of-Printify-Integration\">Key Benefits of Printify Integration</a></li><li><a href=\"#Important-Notes-&amp;-Limitations\">Important Notes &amp; Limitations</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-To-Generate-Printify-API-Token\">How To Generate Printify API Token</a></li><li><a href=\"#How-To-Connect-Printify-with-CRM\">How To Connect Printify with CRM</a></li></ul><hr style=\"box-sizing: content-box; height: 1px; overflow: visible; margin-left: 0px; border: 0px; opacity: 0.25; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 50px !important; color: rgb(155, 161, 167) !important;\"><h1 class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-4c86c81a-34c9-4fe1-b596-7c390ff59a1d\" dir=\"ltr\" id=\"What-is-Printify-Integration?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 2em; margin-bottom: 0.25rem; margin-left: 0px; font-weight: 400; line-height: 43.75px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: bolder;\">What is Printify Integration?</strong></span></h1><div class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-242d1683-33b4-4edb-b1d2-104510041ab2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(38, 73, 102); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></span></div><p class=\"ql-block\" data-block-id=\"block-242d1683-33b4-4edb-b1d2-104510041ab2\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Printify Integration connects your CRM Ecommerce store to Printify\u2019s print-on-demand (POD) platfor