tica, sans-serif;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">Important note:</strong></span></h2><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-bottom: 0px; margin-left: 0px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"703\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. When creating an ad campaign, strictly adhere to the google ad policies to prevent ad rejections. Below is the link to google ad policies that will act as the guiding source of truth.</span><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span data-identifyelement=\"703\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><a href=\"https://support.google.com/adspolicy/answer/6008942?visit_id=638814115746281060-874345944&amp;rd=1\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(44, 92, 197);\">https://support.google.com/adspolicy/answer/6008942?visit_id=638814115746281060-874345944&amp;rd=1</a></span></p></span></div>\n\t"}, {"slug": "48001239879-how-to-configure-staff-member-selection-in-round-robin-calendars-", "title": "How to configure Staff Member selection in Round Robin Calendars?", "folder": "Calendars", "images": ["../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752932/original/TVc1jSKEBD75RNWK4PhdrkaSm7LSYuQoHga656.png?1684238490", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297755154/original/Py_NjBUA4CTGlZfI8angi_mh3FjIuDlViw49bc.png?1684239071", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752769/original/bpMrud9hVWud7rL_ASwFgrwSpegIcn10gw0520.png?1684238441", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297754296/original/S8YET4qyg4FsDeTD-VfeqImrasRqcdhdTga33f.png?1684238837", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752477/original/hGrdaXdKFgAxVzrm55-oBLenjTT2fAyySA5554.png?1684238353", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752468/original/PyHosj0s7WkkRABGcjqqsPxVPvDGfG-8FQe44f.png?1684238352", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752472/original/gCgsW2yUhtZaZMgSUiMFBZ20orKy-hO09we44f.png?1684238352", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752476/original/-CkHUJNmN6f8IIIuP_0twMYkffirZb3zog5554.png?1684238353", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752474/original/9mcRYS7GAjXuYSyD5R8IWBRErDLm0YuZEQ5554.png?1684238353", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752483/original/UDP0HHpJXwBAK7JVdFJfRGPPUskDLScxXA5554.png?1684238353", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752471/original/KvYp3XmLJnVY2vTCg9kzM8zwk_IzKwoFMwe44f.png?1684238352", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752478/original/sb7883I5_r42MPcNAvBk2_aKCBsAD27Now5554.png?1684238353", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752539/original/RpQtYWw9b3bq1fEh6A6mpc8wWj0Rf8FCZA10ba.png?1684238371", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752536/original/ITEVYPxOevxwZKnxdCpM36vvRI1G2SKJ3Qda80.png?1684238370", "../../../../s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/48297752528/original/wUMiWJZXXegLPWAGcMIHSj3TbLL96UUqZAa715.png?1684238368"], "videos": [], "content": "\n\t\t<p class=\"tdfocus-1684238290047\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">Our booking widget includes a popular feature: Staff Member Selection. This function lets your clients select their preferred staff member when making appointments, offering a personalized touch to their booking experience.</span></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1684238290047\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><p class=\"tdfocus-1684238290047\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><h4 class=\"fd-toc\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1684239334392\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">Covered in this Article</span></strong></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-is-the-Staff-Member-Selection-feature-in-Round-Robin-Calendars?\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">What is the Staff Member Selection feature in Round Robin Calendars?</span></strong></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239514443\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-are-some-practical-usage-cases-for-this-feature?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">What are some practical usage cases for this feature?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239516238\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#What-are-some-notable-benefits-of-this-feature?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">What are some notable benefits of this feature?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239546299\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-to-use-the-Staff-Member-Selection-feature-in-Round-Robin-Calendars?\"><strong class=\"tdfocus-1684239520937\" dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">How to use the Staff Member Selection feature in Round Robin Calendars?</span></strong></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239415802\" style=\"margin-left: 20px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#How-does-Rescheduling-work-with-this-feature?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">How does Rescheduling work with this feature?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239533948\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Rescheduling-from-the-Contact's-Appointments-Tab-Internally%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Rescheduling from the Contact's Appointments Tab Internally:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239539755\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Rescheduling-from-the-Appointments-Tab-in-the-Calendars-Menu%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Rescheduling from the Appointments Tab in the Calendars Menu:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239542146\" style=\"margin-left: 40px; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Client-Rescheduling-on-Their-End%3A\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Client Rescheduling on Their End:</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239551057\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#FAQs\"><strong dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">FAQs</span></strong></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Q%3A-What-happens-if-a-staff-member-leaves-our-organization-or-is-temporarily-unavailable?-How-does-this-feature-handle-such-scenarios?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: What happens if a staff member leaves our organization or is temporarily unavailable? How does this feature handle such scenarios?</span></a></span></h4><h4 style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Q%3A-Can-I-limit-the-number-of-appointments-a-staff-member-can-have-daily,-even-if-they-are-selected-more-frequently?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can I limit the number of appointments a staff member can have daily, even if they are selected more frequently?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239564620\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Q%3A-How-does-the-system-handle-holidays-or-off-days-for-individual-staff-members?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: How does the system handle holidays or off days for individual staff members?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239562505\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Q%3A-Can-we-enable-or-disable-this-feature-for-specific-time-slots-or-services?\"><span style=\"color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can we enable or disable this feature for specific time slots or services?</span></a></span></h4><h4 class=\"tdfocus-1684239571658\"><a dir=\"ltr\" href=\"#Q%3A-Can-clients-see-the-expertise-or-skills-of-each-staff-member-before-making-their-selection?\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px; color: rgb(41, 105, 176);\">Q: Can clients see the expertise or skills of each staff member before making their selection?</span></a></h4><p class=\"tdfocus-1684238290047\" dir=\"ltr\"><br></p><hr><h2 class=\"tdfocus-1684177376726\" id=\"What-is-the-Staff-Member-Selection-feature-in-Round-Robin-Calendars?\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-weight: 400; line-height: 35px; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); margin: 0px; font-size: 1.5em; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; background-color: initial; font-family: inherit;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 700;\">What is the Staff Member Selection feature in Round Robin Calendars?</strong></span></h2><p class=\"tdfocus-1684177400637\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">The \"Staff Member Selection\" feature significantly enhances your booking system, specifically designed to increase the flexibility and personalization of your service offerings.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Primarily, it operates within the framework of the Round Robin calendar system in conjunction with the Neo widget type. When this feature is enabled, a dropdown menu appears on the booking widget, which lists all the team members who are part of that particular Round Robin calendar.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This opens up a new layer of choice for the end users, the appointees. They can now select a specific staff member while scheduling an appointment, thus allowing them to choose who they wish to interact with during their appointment.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">This feature has been carefully designed to accommodate scenarios where a selected staff member may be unavailable. In such instances, a message will be displayed to the user indicating the unavailability and suggesting the following available slots.</p><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px 0px 0px 20px; font-size: 13px; line-height: 18px; word-break: normal; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgb(24, 50, 71); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;  text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">Moreover, it fully supports the Rescheduling of appointments. During this process, the user is shown the staff selection again, allowing them to either stick with their original choice or opt for a different staff member.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"